contract={'schema':'cqc.pass6.original-fury-source-contract/1','uid':'core__fury','game':'Metal Gear Solid 3: Snake Eater (2004), original PlayStation 2','selectedCostume':'Original Cobra Unit Fury black Soviet cosmonaut fire suit, closed bronze helmet','physicallyInspectedPrimaryReferenceFiles':[r['file'] for r in approved_sources],'identityDecisions':['Closed bronze/dark reflective round helmet with original БЕЙ inscription, high dark neck seal. Burned face is partly visible behind reflective original PS2 visor in closeup, but not exposed; small sprite keeps restrained dark reflection.','Black ribbed/segmented Soviet space suit, black full gloves and angular heavy high boots; no camouflage, bare head, NASA patch or remake features.','Anatomical RIGHT-hand tubular flamethrower with rear trigger grip and hose connected to backpack; LEFT hand can support tube or perform versus jab/grapple. Original Konami frontal stance shows anatomical right-hand weapon; generated anatomy follows intended same handedness both views.','Twin PALE BEIGE/GREY rear vertical cylinders and thin black transverse triangular propulsor booms with small outer nozzles verified specifically from PS2 reverse shot21885 and close mechanical shot21845. Hidden exact underside hose connectors partly unresolved.','Body six independent native PNG sheets, no mirroring/pixel edit/resize; 72 authored versus action keyframes, not original PS2 animation exports. Fire jets separate native atlas only, never baked on body.'],'unchangedRawProfileSha256':sha(P/'CURRENT_FIGHTER_PROFILE.json'),'fidelityStatus':'closest_supported','absolute1to1Certified':False,'bounds':'Current versus timings/damage/costs/heat/one-hit armor/trap duration/bounded jump are authored existing game rules; this art production does not edit any engine or combat profile.'}
